{"summary":"皮腰袋是《本草纲目》记载的一种药材，烧灰后用于治疗麻风疮疡。其性味未见详述，主要功效为祛风解毒，外用或入药。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《本草纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"大风疠疮。烧灰入药（时珍）。","translation":"主治麻风病疮疡。将皮腰袋烧成灰后入药使用（李时珍）。"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#皮腰袋","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}